year: fiscal year 2023 runs 2023-01-29 to 2024-02-03 (371 days, 53 weeks, including the extra week)
quarter: quarter 4 runs 2023-10-29 to 2024-02-03 (98 days, 14 weeks, including the extra week)
period: period 12 runs 2023-12-31 to 2024-02-03 (35 days, 5 weeks, including the extra week)
week: week 53 runs 2024-01-28 to 2024-02-03 (7 days, 1 weeks, the extra week); 2024-02-03 is day 7 of the week
